@API.http
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5070

### Weather (scaffold original)
GET {{baseUrl}}/weatherforecast
Accept: application/json

### Login (devuelve accessToken y guarda la cookie aeteme_refresh)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "superadmin@aeteme.local",
  "contrasena": "12345678"
}

### Renovar sesión (usa la cookie aeteme_refresh y la rota)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/renovar
Cookie: aeteme_refresh={{refreshToken}}

### Cerrar sesión (requiere el accessToken del login/renovar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/cerrar
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Cookie: aeteme_refresh={{refreshToken}}
